    K_2 =  -3.33148174  +2.26876444i
    K_3 =  -3.33148174  -2.26876444i
    K_4 =  +0.97663991  +0.71053934i
    Trace = 6.66666667 (should be rational)
    Norm  = 269.59670782 (should be rational)
